{"capturado_en": "2026-11-17T18:25:05+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Mad Pantser", "steam_appid": 3235600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Is &quot;The Mad Pantser&quot;?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Mad Pantser</i> is more than just your typical survival horror game. It’s a tongue-in-cheek, point-and-click journey filled with unexpected twists, mini-games, and a healthy dose of satire. While you may find some creepy moments, this game isn’t about making you sleep with the lights on—it’s about keeping you on your toes and laughing out loud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why You Should Play</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silly/Fun Gameplay</strong>: Dive into a world where you’ll encounter everything from intense &quot;horror&quot; elements to quirky mini-games and even a full-on chess match! One moment you’re dodging a killer, the next you’re immersed in a retro video game within the game. Every twist keeps things unpredictable!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satirical Storyline</strong>: Play as Jon, navigating through absurd, darkly humorous scenarios that poke fun at typical horror tropes. It's a wild ride of witty dialogue, unexpected events, and bizarre encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror… But Not Too Much!</strong>: Sure, it’s labeled as a horror game, but don’t expect sleepless nights filled with fear. Instead, prepare for a rollercoaster of thrills, chills, and a lot of laughs!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Jon and his friends as they face challenges that are as ridiculous as they are dangerous. Who will survive the madness? Who will figure out what’s really going on? And will Jon ever stop being an idiot?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out in <i>The Mad Pantser</i>, where survival meets satire, and nothing is ever what it seems. Are you brave enough—or just curious enough—to play?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Is &quot;The Mad Pantser&quot;?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Mad Pantser</i> is more than just your typical survival horror game. It’s a tongue-in-cheek, point-and-click journey filled with unexpected twists, mini-games, and a healthy dose of satire. While you may find some creepy moments, this game isn’t about making you sleep with the lights on—it’s about keeping you on your toes and laughing out loud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why You Should Play</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silly/Fun Gameplay</strong>: Dive into a world where you’ll encounter everything from intense &quot;horror&quot; elements to quirky mini-games and even a full-on chess match! One moment you’re dodging a killer, the next you’re immersed in a retro video game within the game. Every twist keeps things unpredictable!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satirical Storyline</strong>: Play as Jon, navigating through absurd, darkly humorous scenarios that poke fun at typical horror tropes. It's a wild ride of witty dialogue, unexpected events, and bizarre encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror… But Not Too Much!</strong>: Sure, it’s labeled as a horror game, but don’t expect sleepless nights filled with fear. Instead, prepare for a rollercoaster of thrills, chills, and a lot of laughs!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Jon and his friends as they face challenges that are as ridiculous as they are dangerous. Who will survive the madness? Who will figure out what’s really going on? And will Jon ever stop being an idiot?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out in <i>The Mad Pantser</i>, where survival meets satire, and nothing is ever what it seems. Are you brave enough—or just curious enough—to play?</p>", "short_description": "Dawg, we getting pantsed up